al being cut by a laser in the supplier brochure","caption":"Supplier reference — cutting equipment shown by our production partner."},{"src":"/assets/supplier/supplier-cutting-bed.webp","alt":"Cutting bed shown in the supplier brochure","caption":"Supplier reference — equipment reference; no throughput or accuracy claim."},{"src":"/assets/supplier/supplier-forming-equipment.webp","alt":"Letter forming equipment shown in the supplier brochure","caption":"Supplier reference — forming equipment reference, not a guarantee of a particular construction."}]');

